      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[28].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6a7c7f1be968f54891ad2b593629930, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[29].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6a7c7f1be968f54891ad2b593629930, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[2].Dialogue
      value: Let me regale to you the tale of the first Whale as you prepare yourself
        to receive their good graces above-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[30].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6a7c7f1be968f54891ad2b593629930, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[31].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6a7c7f1be968f54891ad2b593629930, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[32].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6a7c7f1be968f54891ad2b593629930, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[33].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[3].Dialogue
      value: "Uh, that\u2019s.. really not necessary..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[4].Dialogue
      value: "Ah, but it is! So very much, necessary. You\u2019ve come from far,
        haven\u2019t you? It\u2019s a pleasure to know the whale\u2019s call is reaching
        further and further. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[5].Dialogue
      value: 'But it is a shame to see so many people arrive in such a sorry state.
        It seems the world is becoming crueler to those still left behind. If only
        they could make up their minds such as you have. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[6].Dialogue
      value: "The Whales tell me it\u2019s only a matter of time before that despicable
        Beast from the deep awakens and takes all of humanity with it! "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[7].Dialogue
      value: "To think, that during our pursuit of the divine those cave dwellers
        were digging up such an afwul influence!! Best to leave their sins behind
        and ascend to the kingdom of the whales while they\u2019re still able."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[8].Dialogue
      value: "But it seems they\u2019ve made up their minds.. I cannot offer salvation
        to those who refuse it. And I wont step foot into that awful place. I\u2019m
        content staying where I am. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[9].Dialogue
      value: The Whales spread their word well enough, and I exert what influence
        I still have from the safety of their newfound nest!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[10].Dialogue
      value: <You decide to interrupt Ishmael before he can talk more.>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[11].Dialogue
      value: 'Oh, the whales! Such elegant, beautiful creatures! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[12].Dialogue
      value: Once you take the time to look above you and see them with your own
        eyes, you will understand.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[13].Dialogue
      value: 'I have been blessed with their presence for many years now, and many
        more to come. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[14].Dialogue
      value: 'I believe they are the reason I have been able to live this long; that
        I might help spread the word of their coming to earth, and encourage travels
        in their final few steps towards salvation. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[15].Dialogue
      value: In return they offer me a glimpse into their paradise through my body
        and the tower.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[16].Dialogue
      value: I see no reason why one would not be able to make it. Roads have been
        constructed, tunnels dug, ramps built, one could even use a horse and carriage!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[17].Dialogue
      value: But there are people out there who have changed beyond recognition.
        Who can hardly walk or think clearly.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[18].Dialogue
      value: Don't they deserve a chance to escape too? Or to be helped?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[19].Dialogue
      value: 'Oh, you talk of the divine influence over the body the whales have?
        Gaze upon me, it is a blessing! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[20].Dialogue
      value: They have granted me a glimpse into their divine realm for they know
        I cannot reach it yet. They are benevolent and all-knowing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[21].Dialogue
      value: 'They have heightened my senses, cleared my mind. My body is protected
        and soon the growth of these wings may be complete, and- '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[22].Dialogue
      value: ': -Yes, I believe they have even granted me the highest honor- to be
        immortal until I am the last remain of humanity.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[23].Dialogue
      value: 'It is a futile resistance. Those people are confused, or frightened
        of what they do not understand. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[24].Dialogue
      value: Perhaps you have met one of those radical protestors? They have been
        around since the beginning of the tower's construction.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[25].Dialogue
      value: First they were many, but over the years I have seen more and more of
        them go up those stairs never return.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[26].Dialogue
      value: "I think this says enough. This is our true purpose, something I\u2019ve
        worked tirelessly to achieve for decades!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[27].Dialogue
      value: 'Ahem, me and the builders, of course.. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[28].Dialogue
      value: 'And even now, people still hold on to this old, decaying world.. I
        pity them, and hope they make up their minds soon. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[29].Dialogue
      value: This is inevitable, after all.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[30].Dialogue
      value: "Oh, don\u2019t fret over that."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[31].Dialogue
      value: "Perhaps that\u2019s a subject matter for another time.."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[32].Dialogue
      value: 'Before you go, traveler, let me tell you the story of the first Whale!
        and the punishment of the mad captain who dared to hunt it-- '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[33].Dialogue
      value: That's really not necessary..
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[3].Choices.Array.size
