      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[5].Dialogue
      value: "     < As it speaks, you can\u2019t make out where the voice is coming
        from. >"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[6].Dialogue
      value: "No, that\u2019s alright. I\u2019m beyond help, and have been for a
        long time. But perhaps I can help you?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[7].Dialogue
      value: You seem to be on your way to the tower. I understand from passing figures
        before you that the gates on the bridges have been closed.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[8].Dialogue
      value: They are. Is there a way back up to the tower from here?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[9].Dialogue
      value: There is, but humor me with a conversation, first? I would like to hear
        your story, stranger.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[10].Dialogue
      value: 'I can''t give you much context on where I''m from. It''s a town with
        no name, far from here. It took me many nights to get here. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[11].Dialogue
      value: 'You must be exhausted. Especially if you travelled them all on foot,
        alone. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[12].Dialogue
      value: I.. guess I am. But it won't matter soon, will it?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[13].Dialogue
      value: It can still matter, if you want it to. You still matter. Up until the
        final moments, and even after.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[14].Dialogue
      value: You always leave something behind. A legacy. Your words echo through
        the words of the people you've met. Everything you do and say in this world
        can matter, to others, to the environment, to generations after yours.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[15].Dialogue
      value: That's true immortality, to me. To echo on forever.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[16].Dialogue
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[17].Dialogue
      value: 'I came here because word of the tower spread to our town. We were suffering
        through a famine, and I thought this would be a good... Solution? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[18].Dialogue
      value: I didn't have any influence there. And I didn't feel like I was leaving
        anyone behind. I had no one to care for, and no one caring for me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[19].Dialogue
      value: I'm sorry to hear that. You must have felt very alone.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[20].Dialogue
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[21].Dialogue
      value: We all felt alone, I think. We knew not all of us would make it through
        the coming winter, and I think it made it so we stopped caring for each other.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[22].Dialogue
      value: ' So we would mourn less when the inevitable came.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[23].Dialogue
      value: 'The prospect of death makes us uncaring, sometimes reckless. When the
        tower was done, and the gates were opened, many rushed to be ascended. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[24].Dialogue
      value: 'Trampled bodies littered the halls of the tower. I wonder if they lay
        there still. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[25].Dialogue
      value: 'I doubt there was anyone left to give them a proper burial. The old
        and sick were left behind. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[26].Dialogue
      value: Its strange to me, that thinking we will be pardoned for our sins only
        makes us more likely to commit them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[27].Dialogue
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[28].Dialogue
      value: 'If you choose to ascend, I hope you will no longer feel alone there.
        In the meantime, you will always have a place here. Among the lost. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[29].Dialogue
      value: I know the feeling. I miss mine too. For years, this tower was my home.
        I practically lived here, together with Ishmael.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[30].Dialogue
      value: He was the idealist, and I the one responsible for realizing his ideals.
        We were a force to be reckoned with, haha..
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[31].Dialogue
      value: "But, it also meant I was one of the first to start.. shifting. That\u2019s
        what they call it now. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[32].Dialogue
      value: We did not know what it was, and humanity fears the unknown. So they
        cast me out. Even Ishmael. He pretends he does not know me, now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[33].Dialogue
      value: "Or, perhaps he\u2019s forgotten about me over the years. I\u2019m not
        sure how we\u2019re both still even alive. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[34].Dialogue
      value: "Perhaps we\u2019re both still holding on to something.. resentment,
        mourning, hope."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[35].Dialogue
      value: "No, I don\u2019t miss my living space in the tower, nor whom I shared
        the dream with. I miss my home, back in the village. Before we started building
        up. Before the easy way out."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[36].Dialogue
      value: When we struggled, for a purpose.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[37].Dialogue
      value: When we still felt human.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[38].Dialogue
      value: Goodbye, stranger. Thank you for speaking with me. I hope we meet again.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6124249128449942710, guid: daf638eb82a5c614ea09d127254cb810, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[3].Choices.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
