      objectReference: {fileID: 1683894718}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'ChoiceButtons.Array.data[1]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1640469860}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'ChoiceButtons.Array.data[2]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1027781406}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.size
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[5].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eaff7ea8a8cfb0e45b2ee58dbe2e539a, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[8].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 515e4abd29eb1b646821cccb6447df7c, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[9].Speaker
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a47631f9fe0cece4ab84178e5649e0ae, type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[4].Dialogue
      value: 'What''s so funny? Aren''t they true? I''ve heard people talking about
        the tower on my journey here, people who worked on it. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[5].Dialogue
      value: They aren't lying. They can't be. What about the posters, and flyers?
        And that strange condition everyone seems have?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[6].Dialogue
      value: Ahahaha, haha! Ahh, I'm sorry. No, it is true, I've seen it with my
        own eyes. But it does something strange to you. My husband seemed not to
        notice, but when it came down to it I couldn't follow him.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[7].Dialogue
      value: I chose to stay long ago. My husband would never forgive me if I chased
        him now, and I don't think my old legs could support me anymore.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[8].Dialogue
      value: But you can learn from my mistake! When you get there, don't hesitate.
        Or, hahaha, do hesitate! Then you might see the humor in it!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3503505647486746933, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueSegments.Array.data[9].Dialogue
      value: '     <She laughs an almost painful sounding laugh again. It devolves
        into a coughing fit. You decide to let the woman sit with her regrets. > '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: f64ec614131ccf74cb3cc16e254ecfd8, type: 3}
